// Jest Snapshot v1, https://jestjs.io/docs/snapshot-testing

exports[`publishSummary lists the runs left out and why 1`] = `
"### TestivAI reports published

**[Open the reports site](https://testivai.github.io/testivai-example/)** — the last 3 runs of each open pull request, and the latest run on main.

#### main

- [Latest run on main](https://testivai.github.io/testivai-example/main/) · 1 changed · 0 passed · [CI run 1](https://github.com/testivai/testivai-example/actions/runs/1), attempt 1

#### Open pull requests

- [#14](https://github.com/testivai/testivai-example/pull/14) PR 14 · [latest run](https://testivai.github.io/testivai-example/pr/14/3-1/) · 1 changed · 0 passed · [all 1 run](https://testivai.github.io/testivai-example/pr/14/)
- [#15](https://github.com/testivai/testivai-example/pull/15) · from a fork · [latest run](https://testivai.github.io/testivai-example/pr/15/4-1/) · 1 changed · 0 passed · [all 1 run](https://testivai.github.io/testivai-example/pr/15/)

#### Not published

- [Run 2](https://github.com/testivai/testivai-example/actions/runs/2) of [#14](https://github.com/testivai/testivai-example/pull/14): the site would be over its 4 MB budget
"
`;

exports[`publishSummary lists the site, main's latest run and each pull request's, as the front page does 1`] = `
"### TestivAI reports published

**[Open the reports site](https://testivai.github.io/testivai-example/)** — the last 3 runs of each open pull request, and the latest run on main.

#### main

- [Latest run on main](https://testivai.github.io/testivai-example/main/) · 1 passed · [CI run 1](https://github.com/testivai/testivai-example/actions/runs/1), attempt 1

#### Open pull requests

- [#14](https://github.com/testivai/testivai-example/pull/14) PR 14 · [latest run](https://testivai.github.io/testivai-example/pr/14/3-1/) · 1 changed · 0 passed · [all 2 runs](https://testivai.github.io/testivai-example/pr/14/)
- [#15](https://github.com/testivai/testivai-example/pull/15) · from a fork · [latest run](https://testivai.github.io/testivai-example/pr/15/4-1/) · 1 changed · 0 passed · [all 1 run](https://testivai.github.io/testivai-example/pr/15/)
